/* ============================================================
   Copy this file to secrets.h and fill in the real values.
   secrets.h is gitignored and must never be committed.

   The sketch compiles without secrets.h — every feature that needs a
   value here is simply disabled when the value is empty, so the firmware
   still builds and runs on a machine that does not have the file.

   Note the limit of this approach: these end up in the firmware image and
   can be read out with esptool by anyone holding the device. That is
   acceptable for the health ping URL (worst case someone suppresses an
   alarm they would need physical access to reach) but think again before
   putting anything stronger here.
   ============================================================ */

#pragma once

// healthchecks.io ping URL for the dead man's switch. Empty = disabled.
// Recommended settings on their side: period 5 min, grace 15 min, which
// alerts 20 minutes after the last successful ping.
#define HEALTHCHECK_URL "https://hc-ping.com/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
